<title>USA: Bayonne, N.J., won by Ryan, Beck.</title>
<headline>Bayonne, N.J., won by Ryan, Beck.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ryan, Beck &amp; Co said it won $13.744 million of Bayonne, N.J., school bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.095 percent.</p>
</text>
